r Art", "keywords": ["car", "racing", "driving", "simulator"], "long_description": "# ApexX Racing Championship\n\n**ApexX Racing Championship by Winter Art** brings high-speed racing action to VR. Get behind the wheel, master challenging tracks, and push your driving skills to the limit as you compete for championship glory.\n\n\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f **5 Exciting Racing Tracks**\nRace across 5 unique tracks, each designed to challenge your speed, control, and racing skills. Learn every corner, find the perfect racing line, and fight for the best times.\n\n\ud83c\udfc1 **High-Speed VR Racing**\nFeel the excitement of being behind the wheel with an immersive VR racing experience. Accelerate, brake, steer, and take on every corner as you chase victory.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 **Live Showroom**\nExplore the new **Live Showroom**, where you can get up close with the cars and experience them in an immersive VR environment.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 **Compete for Championship Glory**\nEvery race is a chance to improve your skills, master the tracks, and become the ultimate ApexX Racing Champion.\n\n### Coming With the Launch\n\n\u2022 5 challenging racing tracks\n\u2022 Live Showroom experience\n\u2022 Immersive VR driving\n\u2022 High-speed racing action\n\u2022 Multiple cars and racing experiences\n\u2022 Competitive championship gameplay\n\u2022 Designed for Meta Quest VR\n\n**Pre-order ApexX Racing Championship today and get ready to hit the track!**\n\n**ApexX Racing Championship \u2014 Race Fast. Master the Track. Become Champion.**\n\n*Features and content may be updated or expanded after launch.*\n", "short_description": "Get ready for high-speed VR racing in **ApexX Racing Championship by Winter Art**! Experience intense races, explore 5 challenging tracks, and check out the new Live Showroom. Pre-order now and get ready to race!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/winterart/home/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null